    "doctor.cli.notOnPath": {
      "comment": "Detail line of a check in the setup window's Details list; it follows the check's title, so it is a fragment with no final period. The rh command is linked at path %@, but the folder that holds the link is not in the PATH list of the shell. PATH is an environment variable: keep it.",
