    "doctor.fix.extensionEnable": {
      "comment": "Fix line under a check in the setup window's Details list: what the person should do. A sentence. The Settings path is what macOS shows in the person's language: use exactly the path given in the glossary.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "شغّل `rh setup`، أو فعّل Right Here في إعدادات النظام › عام › عناصر الدخول والملحقات › Finder."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`rh setup` চালান, অথবা System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › Finder-এর অধীনে Right Here চালু করুন।"
